      "title": "Improving Suggestions via Function Names",
      "sourceHash": "8f44750116a59cc2d855985bd2f12892589b15d21b98ce666510ec850695f55c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 1.95,
          "en": "Now, in programming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.95,
          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "it's pretty common to write functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 8.01,
          "en": "so that you can define code that can be reused",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.01,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "in different parts of your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.23,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "and also so that you can keep certain parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 18.74,
          "en": "of your application lean by outsourcing code into functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "And GitHub Copilot really shines when it comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 25.59,
          "en": "to writing functions because, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.59,
          "end": 27.36,
          "en": "when creating a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.36,
          "end": 29.61,
          "en": "you're giving that function a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "and that name then allows GitHub Copilot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "to suggest which code should go into this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "For example, here I wanna write a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "that should generate a random integer number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "starting at zero, up to a certain maximum number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 50.85,
          "en": "which I can define when calling that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.85,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "which I then wanna use to draw a random item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "from that React descriptions array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 61.083,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll name that function here, genRandomInt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "And I already get a suggestion here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "that even already includes such a max parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 72.84,
          "en": "though if that would not be included, I could, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.84,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "add it myself to give GitHub Copilot more hints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 78.45,
          "en": "about what I'm trying to achieve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.45,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "And then in the end here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "after typing some extra characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 86.58,
          "en": "I'm getting a suggestion for the complete function body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 90.6,
          "en": "and for the complete remaining code of that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "which I might wanna implement to achieve my goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 98.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now, you can, by the way, also hover over these suggestions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.78999999999999,
          "end": 102.09,
          "en": "and then accept the suggestion or just parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.09,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "of the exception with that context menu that opens up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "And you also got some additional options here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 111.75,
          "en": "But here I'm happy with the entire suggestion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.75,
          "end": 114.093,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll just accept it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.57,
          "en": "And now with that function added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.57,
          "end": 120.27,
          "en": "if I go back here to this header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "I can use this function to generate a random index,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 128.043,
          "en": "which I wanna use to access a random word in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.24,
          "end": 132.36,
          "en": "And here it might be enough to just write const",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.36,
          "end": 136.92000000000002,
          "en": "to get GitHub Copilot to suggest some code that indeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "does allow me to generate such a random index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 143.64,
          "en": "If I would have not gotten this suggestion here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "I could, of course, simply have typed randomIndex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "and chances are high",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 151.083,
          "en": "that I would have then gotten that suggestion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.34,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "And with that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 157.2,
          "en": "I can now use this randomIndex down here again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.2,
          "end": 159.003,
          "en": "by using GitHub Copilot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.26,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "And of course, you're still allowed to write code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 165.36,
          "en": "on your own when using GitHub Copilot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.36,
          "end": 168.27,
          "en": "But as you see here, it's not uncommon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.27,
          "end": 170.61,
          "en": "for you to just write some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.61,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "and to just give GitHub Copilot some hints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "about what you're trying to achieve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 179.07,
          "en": "And you then start accepting those suggestions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.07,
          "end": 182.193,
          "en": "hence boosting your productivity as a developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.27,
          "end": 188.16,
          "en": "And with all that done, if I now move this random word",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
